        "book": "Blood & Brine homebrew",
        "custom": "Mikey"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Mikey was the Valencruz boys' dog. When he fell gravely ill, their father had him 'fixed' in the Silk Court (Laziel's experiments) and he came back emotionless and obedient. Nyx renamed him <strong>Morrow</strong>. One actor, one token: Mikey is the dog, Morrow is the 1 minute transformation (Transformation: Morrow). Hired escort Jack keeps him on a spiked leash.</p><p><strong>Balance note (CR 1):</strong> HP 32, AC 13 as on the live sheet (below the DMG CR 1 HP band 71-85 on purpose: a pet, not a boss). Morrow deals about 24 a round with Feral Frenzy and Rend.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
